{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" finds each record’s span from the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the event was tracked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to the right"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked, and carries"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the event’s description under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"names."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Span events can’t be added to a span that has ended. A record tracked outside any span, or whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"span ended before its batch was delivered, is left out. Batch tightly enough for your spans to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"outlive their batches, and deliver to another destination as well for the events that must not be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lost. To write events to your logs instead, use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggerDestination"},{"type":"text","text":" in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"LoggingDestinations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"module."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker()","let delivery = tracker.records.batch().deliver(to: SpanEventDestination(tracer: tracer))","let span = tracer.startSpan(\"checkout\")","ServiceContext.withValue(span.context) {","    tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","}","await tracker.finish()","try await delivery.execute()","span.end()"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The umbrella guide on this area is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination"],"title":"Destinations","anchor":"Destinations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","symbolKind":"module","modules":[{"name":"TracingDestinations"}],"title":"TracingDestinations","externalID":"TracingDestinations","role":"collection"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations"},"references":{"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A destination that adds each tracked event to the span that was active when it was tracked."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations","title":"TracingDestinations","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations"},"doc://TracingDestinations/documentation/TracingDestinations/SpanEventDestination":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"A destination that adds each event to the span that was active when the event was tracked.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/TracingDestinations\/documentation\/TracingDestinations\/SpanEventDestination","title":"SpanEventDestination","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/tracingdestinations\/spaneventdestination"},"https://tyler-keith-thompson.github.io/Traffluent/documentation/traffluent/choosingdestinations":{"title":"Choosing Destinations","url":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choosing Destinations"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/choosingdestinations"}}}